---
title: Standing Oblique & Lat Stretch
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![растяжка косой мышцы живота и широчайшей мышцы спины](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37abf98d-ac96-4591-9985-e837e9cce68d)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Stand up straight with your feet shoulder-width apart. Raise your right arm straight up overhead.

### Step 2
Gently lean your torso to the left while reaching your right arm overhead to the left, feeling the stretch along the right side of your body.

### Step 3
Hold this position for 15–20 seconds, then slowly return to the starting position.

### Step 4
Complete the desired number of reps, then repeat the stretch on the other side.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Never push the stretch to the point of sharp pain.

• Try to keep the stretched side of your body as relaxed as possible.
{{< /callout >}}
